#: ../../library/imp.rst:2
msgid ":mod:`!imp` --- Access the import internals"
msgstr ":mod:`!imp` --- Přístup k interním částem importu"

#: ../../library/imp.rst:10
msgid ""
"This module is no longer part of the Python standard library. It was "
":ref:`removed in Python 3.12 <whatsnew312-removed-imp>` after being "
"deprecated in Python 3.4."
msgstr ""
"Tento modul již není součástí standardní knihovny Pythonu. Byl "
":ref:`odstraněn v Pythonu 3.12 <whatsnew312-removed-imp>` po vyřazení v "
"Pythonu 3.4."

#: ../../library/imp.rst:14
msgid ""
"The :ref:`removal notice <whatsnew312-removed-imp>` includes guidance for "
"migrating code from :mod:`!imp` to :mod:`importlib`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Oznámení o odstranění <whatsnew312-removed-imp>` obsahuje pokyny pro "
"migraci kódu z :mod:`!imp` na :mod:`importlib`."

#: ../../library/imp.rst:17
msgid ""
"The last version of Python that provided the :mod:`!imp` module was `Python "
"3.11 <https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/imp.html>`_."
msgstr ""
"Poslední verzí Pythonu, která poskytovala modul :mod:`!imp`, byla `Python "
"3.11 <https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/imp.html>`_."
